    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d434">

                <pb facs="0464" n="1198" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1198"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Dupuy de Lôme to
                        Mr. Adee.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of Spain</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Swampscott
                                Mass.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1895-09-08"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">September 8,
                    1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Secretary</hi>: Acknowledging receipt of your
                    note dated 5th instant, I have the honor to tender to your excellency my thanks
                    to the <pb facs="0465" n="1199" xml:id="pg1199"/> Government of the United
                    States and to the Federal authorities who have intervened in the capture of arms
                    and ammunition near Cedar Keys.</p>
                <p>At the same time I take pleasure in undertaking that the Spanish consul in
                    Florida will make in due time the sworn statement which you mention as necessary
                    in order to establish judicial proceedings.</p>
                <p>I avail myself, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">E. Dupuy de Lôme</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
